  "details": "The open beta patch notes said:\n\n```\n\nDesktop HUD users can opt-in to show the classic mic indicator in the bottom-left of the screen. \n\n- You can find the option under the Main Menu Settings→Audio & Voice→Mic Icon Position. \n\n  - Your options here will be \"Bottom Left,\" \"Top Right,\" and \"Both.\"\n\n    - If the bottom-left indicator is enabled, it is excluded from the overall HUD opacity multiplier. \n\n```\n\nHowever, when I turn off the desktop HUD and set the mic icon to bottom left, it's still hidden, despite the claim that it's excluded from the HUD opacity multiplier.",
